    "start": "00:03:27.105",
    "end": "00:03:30.015",
    "start_seconds": 207.105,
    "end_seconds": 210.015,
    "text": "Not with memorization, not with the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.015",
    "end": "00:03:32.325",
    "start_seconds": 210.015,
    "end_seconds": 212.325,
    "text": "careful choice of vocabulary, not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.325",
    "end": "00:03:34.605",
    "start_seconds": 212.325,
    "end_seconds": 214.605,
    "text": "with sentence structure, but with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.605",
    "end": "00:03:36.555",
    "start_seconds": 214.605,
    "end_seconds": 216.555,
    "text": "an understanding about what my story"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.555",
    "end": "00:03:38.984",
    "start_seconds": 216.555,
    "end_seconds": 218.984,
    "text": "was, a framework in which I could"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.984",
    "end": "00:03:41.535",
    "start_seconds": 218.984,
    "end_seconds": 221.535,
    "text": "operate, and then the freedom to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.535",
    "end": "00:03:45.825",
    "start_seconds": 221.535,
    "end_seconds": 225.825,
    "text": "create, adjust, modify, be myself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.825",
    "end": "00:03:48.495",
    "start_seconds": 225.825,
    "end_seconds": 228.495,
    "text": "so that I wasn't someone who was."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.049",
    "end": "00:03:51.959",
    "start_seconds": 229.049,
    "end_seconds": 231.959,
    "text": "Reciting memorized words on stage,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.200",
    "end": "00:03:54.959",
    "start_seconds": 232.2,
    "end_seconds": 234.959,
    "text": "but actually telling a story"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.230",
    "end": "00:03:57.989",
    "start_seconds": 235.23,
    "end_seconds": 237.989,
    "text": "from my heart and my mind with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.989",
    "end": "00:03:59.459",
    "start_seconds": 237.989,
    "end_seconds": 239.459,
    "text": "a little bit of planning ahead."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.880",
    "end": "00:04:02.220",
    "start_seconds": 239.88,
    "end_seconds": 242.22,
    "text": "It's not the way I would advise anyone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.220",
    "end": "00:04:04.350",
    "start_seconds": 242.22,
    "end_seconds": 244.35,
    "text": "to go and perform in front of 500 people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.739",
    "end": "00:04:06.209",
    "start_seconds": 244.739,
    "end_seconds": 246.209,
    "text": "It is not the way that you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.209",
    "end": "00:04:07.890",
    "start_seconds": 246.209,
    "end_seconds": 247.89,
    "text": "should ever think about doing it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.185",
    "end": "00:04:10.260",
    "start_seconds": 248.185,
    "end_seconds": 250.26,
    "text": "This is one of those do, as I say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.260",
    "end": "00:04:11.970",
    "start_seconds": 250.26,
    "end_seconds": 251.97,
    "text": "not as I do situations, but what you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.970",
    "end": "00:04:14.700",
    "start_seconds": 251.97,
    "end_seconds": 254.7,
    "text": "should be thinking is structure first."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.165",
    "end": "00:04:17.565",
    "start_seconds": 255.165,
    "end_seconds": 257.565,
    "text": "Once you understand the beginning and the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.565",
    "end": "00:04:19.725",
    "start_seconds": 257.565,
    "end_seconds": 259.725,
    "text": "end, and the scenes and the transitions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.845",
    "end": "00:04:21.464",
    "start_seconds": 259.845,
    "end_seconds": 261.464,
    "text": "and the goals of each one of those"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.464",
    "end": "00:04:23.775",
    "start_seconds": 261.464,
    "end_seconds": 263.775,
    "text": "scenes, once you have that in place, the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.775",
    "end": "00:04:27.525",
    "start_seconds": 263.775,
    "end_seconds": 267.525,
    "text": "sentences that you apply become your own."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.555",
    "end": "00:04:29.235",
    "start_seconds": 267.555,
    "end_seconds": 269.235,
    "text": "And when they really are your own and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.235",
    "end": "00:04:31.485",
    "start_seconds": 269.235,
    "end_seconds": 271.485,
    "text": "not so pre-planned that they feel like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.485",
    "end": "00:04:34.455",
    "start_seconds": 271.485,
    "end_seconds": 274.455,
    "text": "they're memorized and performed, that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.455",
    "end": "00:04:36.645",
    "start_seconds": 274.455,
    "end_seconds": 276.645,
    "text": "is when storytelling becomes alive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.945",
    "end": "00:04:37.125",
    "start_seconds": 276.945,
    "end_seconds": 277.125,
    "text": "So."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.125",
    "end": "00:04:38.460",
    "start_seconds": 277.125,
    "end_seconds": 278.46,
    "text": "Kaia was right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.000",
    "end": "00:04:40.800",
    "start_seconds": 279.0,
    "end_seconds": 280.8,
    "text": "The story I told in the car was very"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.800",
    "end": "00:04:43.560",
    "start_seconds": 280.8,
    "end_seconds": 283.56,
    "text": "different than the story I told on stage"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.560",
    "end": "00:04:46.740",
    "start_seconds": 283.56,
    "end_seconds": 286.74,
    "text": "and yet ultimately it was the same story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.190",
    "end": "00:04:49.050",
    "start_seconds": 287.19,
    "end_seconds": 289.05,
    "text": "So structure, structure"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.050",
    "end": "00:04:50.370",
    "start_seconds": 289.05,
    "end_seconds": 290.37,
    "text": "first, everything else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.430",
    "end": "00:04:51.000",
    "start_seconds": 290.43,
    "end_seconds": 291.0,
    "text": "Second."
  }
]
